{
  "info": {
    "name": "Academy — Packages & Subscriptions Kashier Checkout",
    "_postman_id": "academy-packages-subscriptions-kashier-v1",
    "description": "Real-money Kashier checkout for Flex packages and subscriptions (local_academy + local_payments). Import this file into Postman.\n\nSetup: 1) run \"0. Login (get token)\" once — it saves the token into the {{token}} collection variable automatically. 2) Set {{packageid}} / {{subscriptionid}} to real ids (from the Academy_Packages / Academy_Subscriptions collections' \"Get Available\" requests). 3) Run \"Create ... Checkout\" — it auto-saves {{package_order_id}} / {{subscription_order_id}}. 4) Open the returned checkout_url in a browser and pay on Kashier (sandbox). 5) Run \"Verify ... Payment\".\n\nTwo different endpoints are used here:\n- create_package_checkout / create_subscription_checkout → {{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php (custom dispatcher, `token` param)\n- local_payments_verify_payment → {{base_url}}/webservice/rest/server.php (real Moodle web service, `wstoken` param) — same token value, different param name.\n\nSee docs/api/packages-subscriptions-kashier-mobile-guide.md for the full write-up.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "f65e3a453f23cdf4f550dedc23fc2c31", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "packageid", "value": "6", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "subscriptionid", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "package_order_id", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Populated automatically after Create Package Checkout" },
    { "key": "subscription_order_id", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Populated automatically after Create Subscription Checkout" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login (get token)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "var json = pm.response.json();",
              "if (json && json.token) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
              "    console.log('Saved token to {{token}}');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('No token in response', json);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "urlencoded",
          "urlencoded": [
            { "key": "username", "value": "STUDENT", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "password", "value": "PASSWORD", "type": "text" },
            { "key": "service", "value": "moodle_mobile_app", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/login/token.php",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["login", "token.php"]
        },
        "description": "Exchange username + password for a web-service token. The test script saves it into {{token}}. This same token is reused as {{token}} on api.php calls and as wstoken on webservice/rest/server.php calls below."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Packages — Kashier Checkout",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Package Checkout (POST)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.status === 'success' && json.data && json.data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('package_order_id', json.data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved order_id to {{package_order_id}}:', json.data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Open this checkout_url to pay:', json.data.checkout_url);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('No order_id in response', json);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "create_package_checkout", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "packageid", "value": "{{packageid}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["local", "academy", "api.php"]
            },
            "description": "POST only. Returns {data:{order_id, checkout_url, expires_at, provider, transaction_id}}. Fails with 'You already have an active package' if the one-active-package rule is hit. Re-running while a session is still pending returns the same order_id/checkout_url instead of creating a duplicate."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Package Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "wstoken", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "wsfunction", "value": "local_payments_verify_payment", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "moodlewsrestformat", "value": "json", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "order_id", "value": "{{package_order_id}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/webservice/rest/server.php",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["webservice", "rest", "server.php"]
            },
            "description": "Real Moodle web service (not api.php) — note wstoken/wsfunction params and the different path. Returns {success, status, courseid, enrolled}. For packages/subscriptions ignore courseid/enrolled (always 0/false); just check success + status === 'completed'. Usually just reads a result the Kashier webhook already wrote; falls back to an API check with Kashier if the webhook hasn't landed yet."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Packages (after verify)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_my_packages&token={{token}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["local", "academy", "api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_my_packages" },
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirms the package shows status=active with the right flex balance after a successful checkout."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Subscriptions — Kashier Checkout",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Subscription Checkout (POST)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.status === 'success' && json.data && json.data.order_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('subscription_order_id', json.data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved order_id to {{subscription_order_id}}:', json.data.order_id);",
                  "    console.log('Open this checkout_url to pay:', json.data.checkout_url);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('No order_id in response', json);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "create_subscription_checkout", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "subscriptionid", "value": "{{subscriptionid}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["local", "academy", "api.php"]
            },
            "description": "POST only. Returns {data:{order_id, checkout_url, expires_at, provider, transaction_id}}. Fails with 'You already have an active subscription' if the one-active-subscription rule is hit."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Subscription Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "wstoken", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "wsfunction", "value": "local_payments_verify_payment", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "moodlewsrestformat", "value": "json", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "order_id", "value": "{{subscription_order_id}}", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/webservice/rest/server.php",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["webservice", "rest", "server.php"]
            },
            "description": "Real Moodle web service (not api.php). Returns {success, status, courseid, enrolled}. For subscriptions ignore courseid/enrolled; just check success + status === 'completed'. On success the student is enrolled into the plan's courses."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Subscriptions (after verify)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_my_subscriptions&token={{token}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["local", "academy", "api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_my_subscriptions" },
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirms the subscription shows status=active with the enrolled courses after a successful checkout."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
